    "body": "Hi, PR looks good. To close the issue we would need the import as well, and a small test file that performs tests like this\r\nTest file can just be added in test_circuits.py in the tests directory. \r\n\r\n```python\r\n\r\ndef test_qasm(...)\r\nU = .... \r\n\r\nqasm_string = export_to_qasm(U)\r\nU2 = import_from_qasm(qasm_string)\r\n\r\nvariables = {k:random for k in U.extract_variables())\r\nwfn1 = tq.simulate(U,1 variables)\r\nwfn2 = tq.simulate(U2, variables)\r\n\r\nF = abs(wfn1.inner(wfn2))**2\r\nassert numpy.isclose(F,1.0)\r\n\r\n```",
